# REQUIRES: cuda
# Expected: under three minutes on RTX 5090 with same-frame code reuse.
# Submit this gate with lit --timeout=600; do not extend a slow fixture's budget.
# Approved short trajectory: TIP3P, VELOCITY_VERLET, NVE; stop on failure.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/water_template_trajectory.py %S/Inputs/triclinic %t TIP3P VELOCITY_VERLET NVE
# RUN: mdir-template-trajectory-test %t/control.toml | tee %t/metrics.txt | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: trajectory 100
# CHECK: frame 100 oracle force
# CHECK: short template trajectory and ten fresh physical frames passed
